{"title": "Wild Magic: Telekinesis (Condition)", "pageid": 16585, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Wild_Magic:_Telekinesis_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Telekinesis_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Telekinesis_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Telekinesis_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Telekinesis_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Telekinesis_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Telekinesis_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Telekinesis Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Telekinesis_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Telekinesis_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/33/Telekinesis_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Wild Magic: Telekinesis</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>You are able to use <a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\">Telekinesis</a> without expending a spell slot. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/DisableOverhead\">DisableOverhead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/40px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/60px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/80px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Telekinesis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/40px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Telekinesis\" title=\"Telekinesis\">Telekinesis</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> + <span aria-label=\"Level 5 Spell Slot\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Level 5 Spell Slot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Throw a creature or object up to 18 m (60 ft) with a thought. Once per turn, you can use Telekinesis again without expending a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_Slots\" title=\"Spells\">Spell Slot</a>. </dd>\n</dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Wild_Magic:_Telekinesis\">Sources of Wild Magic: Telekinesis</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic:_Telekinesis\" title=\"Wild Magic: Telekinesis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/30px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/45px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/60px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Magic: Telekinesis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp/30px-Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Telekinesis_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic:_Telekinesis\" title=\"Wild Magic: Teleki